{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1439,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae8cbb1087ad8a6c3213f1d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Good morning──\r\n早上的练跑──完成了。\r\n今天也要──为了使命加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f1a83b5712b751649f4a761b56be6c0bffeea9cb0cb6df112ce7991ce8d6e5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a074e9df10811499c4827ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐──吃了啊。\r\n补给──是作战行动的基础。\r\n可不能……省略。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a87fb784af8c59fd9056bafe2629612e3eb86f9c0352176a1e2e1514f1009560",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa8ef385be95488ce84fbb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hello，状态──如何？\r\n我──如你所见。\r\n──就是──很有精神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d5b9bed3b377ed57e268d239135d3fd848346840c83f996b96a136a22b1a00c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57186735b966da9614ba7581",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡眠不足──会影响到明天的表现。\r\n别轻忽健康管理。\r\n──你……也一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "039fcb80641c7740cc331aec3ad50040ed508c205d7c8bef203a4fc081ce7f21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f443a6614a0976a6ced77c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的工作──结束。\r\n剩余时间……就上网买个水吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b624c6864fd688ac4e9e9c1ef1c6bd1ff30b237eff17e788e2981a3ee1529d3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41efd36dd19416d35ae0829c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近……有新生──\r\n站在远处──看我。\r\n我有听到她说──「头目」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffb74fc937c73eceecb42244eb8d498844be1ba79052545717b6f91e159b307a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2c756c2e92d2188df00faec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才──有锹形虫\r\n停在我的耳朵上……\r\n──Why？",
      "source_fingerprint": "96b2b863b331fe64f33d2dfbfd426504a137920592046a1339dcea1ff563c407",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c785c50aacc66f9bdf13d333",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天……真棒。过了炎热的夏天──\r\n训练成果……会反映在身体上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d466249f23e7028f7020991abc32b7fc9f61d1e90c72556b2b8d08dd14cb98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e3f3a1edbbc1313ab1a87ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒冷的天气──令人……绷紧神经。\r\n让我可以──严以律己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87069904e97ae4cd126df09c0ff22fd7f8b5cd540366630bec23d98e8c57a6c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d231088a1bf9b6651cfb15d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おはよう、ございます――\r\n人形ゆえに――無機質な挨拶に――\r\nしてみた。違いは――出ているか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "148e78407dcaa10dd823492cc620480f7aaaf54f34494f36a5e362b53e34fdfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4febb3519066d61676aae5ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご機嫌麗しゅう、主よ。\r\n本日のscheduleを求む。\r\n…人形に――なりきってみたが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d941068421d7a9621c3dc6fc04ed3b74063f86b93d906a8b4224834ae9552a9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:246c182d069412d9a795922f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私に、昼食は必要ありません。\r\n――すまない――嘘だ。\r\n役に――入り込みすぎた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1640da52c1174ee1cda48a7ce363181ac273919cdbb7958548bb50babfa084d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:952a3dad3658270a73d71f33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "機械人形は――どのような――\r\n食事をする？Oil――か？\r\n――せめて――水が――いいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "876478996f859b7c6ca6caa168299210b35cf57d5833738e02277057b1f78c44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67e041197dd0191111e9109d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Question――機械人形にも\r\n――眠りや――夢は――\r\nあるのだろうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18afd59c2b3c81e20b0f68d7158b1472dae72e52a44c0781e0a0dda915edbcaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62a56f91719e4f8ae4465509",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "機械は――正確に動くもの。\r\n――まもなく就寝時刻。\r\n――寮の門限――遵守。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad47593b371172f1f1f5dc4781a61dd3b24139f803e65ae43b68afa06cce58f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ea8af8497df6db82c1c2827",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "命が――芽吹く季節。機械人形は\r\nそれを見て――どう思うのか。\r\n――私は――鼻が、むずむずする。",
      "source_fingerprint": "670acf7102e7a7017b9b27cb320fa1f9f9807b37e25fc1645f5bd4c8ed5d8a7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc53dde9ecac583148327e3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うだる暑さには――歯車も――\r\n狂いやすくなる。私も――\r\n注意を――払うべきか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d64d3849bc788ef629ba408c8580c3fbdad5bb4d7b4a618c95367c25c8bea816",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd9281a60d0c66e699cfa477",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "機械人形は――寒暖差も――\r\n季節の変わり目も――感じることは\r\nない。少し――羨ましいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afb513a32f7768d94509d875c098dc469fa83d84d27e2fb1ca809202c97fb205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:713f91d429f36d12f0b15bea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定の気温を下回れば――\r\n熱いteaを淹れるようプログラム\r\nされております。しばしお待ちを。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14e75a95181baf5edbb388e0ed5745672ca0f2a344e103a76666ba9c9b373349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5778ee107f566748ddff9f04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Valentine.",
      "source_fingerprint": "0378820a7ae8b8328e030734c3ac408143d0908ff6833c1aa87c3bf1ff05ce26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12bda8f11900c58efc5c9e7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Valentine.",
      "source_fingerprint": "0378820a7ae8b8328e030734c3ac408143d0908ff6833c1aa87c3bf1ff05ce26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a651819120024d3a3df1c70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟我同房的高峰──不会──\r\n干涉任何人──包括我在内。\r\n可以不用顾虑她──很轻松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad6e4685fe0989a72058db5f38ca7e0b0fc211e9e44fa5552575b2d9f8bce5e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff00de8929f5a4a70ee721e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美酒──博学多闻。\r\n而且我发现她有……独特的哲学。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa8c0c301a86ba545e3af7232f6b0b97be7a9ea07f0966251e33d2616106d52c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d2605d0f418b8df559fe6ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这本是英雄──之前在读的小说，\r\n当我说──「以前读过原文版」……\r\n她的反应十分excited。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b29aa43bd1488ff8a5ff52c847ff5c2e4caa16db7c2b535071f51f2d32d903c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf132eb486c6b83fffa59739",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「猫咪躺在茂密的草丛」啊……\r\n不愧是──鲁道夫。\r\n连joke──都很完美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66a48ddffbe6dc14b6d5bfb2ccaca7692ac1baf3649a5a2a42a8b61b6e988d82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ec8a077882baad7d712fa5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每天──\r\n都会向在祖国的父母报告成果。\r\n从来没有──中断过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25031faec86f8db70d5d70e73b31588b12d30d25a4eda2a809e327c933a05b84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdebb91f1e2b7348d7f6db80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Performance也会──\r\n拚上我的全力。\r\n──呼……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dad94091773e868afacb4dd9e9ad2c6fb772c8bf5bace597bfc930e3b7f24cd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec7f3978ff1dc3831ed3d2dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得把裙摆……缩短──\r\n不能绊到脚……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5355c9559d3aa4ebcb6e96a846494b24560680f15cf98875519831d514ef8a67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd8903b29b1c681b9cac1273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这深绿色──\r\n代表着象征家的pride.\r\n我已做好──将其肩负起的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cccc4fe25a92d78ed392f81f73d43c8c1084d9caa03389e57c188b1f04fe2de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fe98e66ae596864553b4795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装──我请人在制作时\r\n──加入了机能性。\r\n是为执行任务而生的──万全装备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "456adfdbf63825627e742ba83a51007375a0d8181b64a3a4e7f5c3d8493c5162",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ecda6c4f24a96e88230c1ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早餐……白饭没味道──\r\n这点还不习惯。\r\n但如果有「香松」──",
      "source_fingerprint": "21bec46ea70b7cf21258aa037b01d76c45305a6bc2f67020ea46eb9252a61bc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8b2edfc557011396d5f843d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贩卖部在促销的──面包，\r\n我买太多了……须在中午前消耗掉。\r\n下午──预计还要消耗热量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0a2a3478881451d7fd97954558df82ea7b826ecf298155aaf1e6ae60babaa31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8673ba805eef9742dadec7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡前──我会喝……温开水。\r\n喝下处于适温──甜味较强的软水。\r\n会提升──睡眠质量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "140ab6a328751828975c9c8342245585678310f14362ab758b2a4a65df162aac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f049a4c9fc265afd548c6cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个国家──有很多樱花树。\r\n盛开后的美──就跟以前……\r\n师父告诉我的一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06572f5ca4ca302e3c092977666858749c9cd3abcab03a4c175ce125205a054a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bdc9e409b465fd7cb5ed91b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Mosquito……蚊子──\r\n会妨碍──我的任务。\r\n我要执行──歼灭作战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be138f5624b3c094de6f893bcc18afcae060904c962c4cd1b51b5fbf66527f4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9171c1abdea714202f9feaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凉感商品……没有卖完。\r\n不……我并不是买太多──\r\n……是明年夏天要用的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8cc196ff3cb68e19d2636a0f74bb17b1768fb09dcfab7aa39cb0e52a8fb2fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c40542a3741288553eaff8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美妙让我体验过的──「暖炉桌」。\r\n那真是──不错。\r\n是个非常棒的──东西……",
      "source_fingerprint": "faa72719b3350907d52edf780b07da69010ac0659f39ab163ad1f5f1fc114d4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2434450737638f5f3f4a0bfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『機械人形とは、また奇怪な』\r\n…ルドルフに言われたが――\r\nそんなに――おかしい役だろうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "adf6987c1dfb3651102924f40ab42a166d087312bf42443aebb9505bad352ab0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227ebc110612b338de34c2d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ファインが――SP隊の制服も――\r\n機械人形風に――してみたい、と。\r\n――目立ちすぎる――と思うが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5966a1b43709153f40f977a945267fe32e95d4d5f87a13a303a947510a568c1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0973d55e94940c21268d114b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私は――目の前の任務。タップは\r\n――大きな夢。視点は――違えど\r\n――想いは――理解できる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10447e03b00b49d03c137826f5246fa388724c54c26dc75cc0a0115d2612efad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7099880c038a4a968379d4f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ギムレットは――感情豊かな演技が\r\n得意だが――反面何を演じても――\r\nギムレットのまま――私も同じだが",
      "source_fingerprint": "01f6360fe301a691ea2c650e07c13ef79c339ec8be7db8ead33933b793d994cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66878fc09c8793393db0db0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シャカール曰く――機械の形態は\r\n――simpleで――あるべきと。\r\nなら――段ボールでも、かぶるか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14565adae8ae0eb3bfc22c3b1ee6760cd110329a9f81661b3feb32bc0b37a35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b03faa1f44b9fa1d08538b27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起動。本日の業務を開始――\r\n――この言い回しでは――むしろ\r\nscience fiction――寄りか",
      "source_fingerprint": "db9d505f35099a3a2ec85ed0e67de88e16bf05cb5f83ec4816731825788e7714",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1183f7462971d667658e2177",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食後のteaはいかがですか？\r\n――本当の機械なら――実に正確な\r\n淹れ方を――するのだろうな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86ab6bdb2e30c5291cc8942e310e2c8dda3d00e0cde8559800dddb7d9501cb6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da02341b90b9480159d72aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そろそろ――就寝か？必要なら――\r\n朝――目覚まし機能を――\r\n実行――するが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a14f0c338c975d420e656389bbb210aceb5777d26707fab2deecaf45df2491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02d1956a1f965151633faeae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうも――新入生の何人かが――\r\n私を――本物の機械人形と――\r\n思っている節が――ある。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17f649fa7a0df77a9368e6240f0a0ed1fda6dbce7901817ccc3ea7b595d16946",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7300220017b0a383c5c12ab1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Shaved ice――\r\n機械人形の――つもりで、食しても\r\n――頭痛は――避けられないか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d13c157039629b1a7ce59989e1e162ba59169f8e830254bb4b85c93cb9084cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:209306893528cb620b3fd04f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Halloween――あまり――\r\n参加したことは――ないが――\r\nこの衣装がある――今なら――",
      "source_fingerprint": "157dba3cebfb0213b3bd2e12e59e9b7aa7d27815d24245cd7cb17ffc6f2ed511",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eec1d475fc118e80d5ae4eb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私は機械人形。寒さなど感じない。\r\n――思い込もうと――してみたが。\r\nどうやら――不可能だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08940f9954ce16df291e2731ef90db710c76d4da9d7900ff5e52f23da12fd610",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6b9e5393b393c0f2befa52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装にある――修繕の形跡。\r\n服としての使命を――懸命に、\r\n果たし続けている――respect.",
      "source_fingerprint": "a53e671e4065a9c8b5d69a26190956addb515d45568ba90412964ef6a576a1a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9ce102e5419eded6ea08405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外で――子どもたちに――強そうな\r\nロボがいる、と――言われた。\r\nそういう設定では――ないのだが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c6fece4b6686bf22e43b0b8bff9eafd97a705b3ae033bbf8485fb03f29b770a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01373f00c24b5b88f02d120e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's get started.\r\n训练员──请下指令。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86150db31e87834dc648b4c2c7a8cf01ffe5629bf1acb3e6b89fdd30f16d1cf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:845fe29d34c437e6601c940e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遂行する",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ce38b5ebbca8b8bf5b5b4917a142eed5cfaacf416234b26fd17a26c783c2b66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9265268417ffb11bfc605c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报恩──\r\n没别的方法──就是训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "774f8dbde92278f5b94a4bcd3e8919c9e6b9b5a581cf4ab918b80d4287b92c82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3306607ec8c53f1e15cf373c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我必定会报答──象征家跟\r\n师父的恩情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5906d05b986c2d5c411330ee8d699f4c64230ff8f2f2008680b1745233aaa1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abf4ad2cfaa8b429f2e7fc1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作业──已经在午休时写完了。\r\n可以心无旁鹜地进行训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51c0e5bc4b433318697019998559fe2ed6be731578554041bd8d6d936443311e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f7c465145d3c0217dd189d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟你的──合作任务。\r\n作战成功率……很高。\r\n──目标是……完全达成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0587995b19a078bdb8577295ddd99e6d0380f825f63a8ad5f47efeeb61b71924",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39b941caab8e1089ce9d103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然是你想的训练项目……\r\n就不会有……不足之处。\r\nLet's go for it.",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f1ba6bfcecfc4cf09343816209b3665698a5e23b58a99333071eb45b2d7c8d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c69d8c10e54e63eaa7edd960",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不需要──说话。\r\n我们──已经有了默契。\r\n我相信──你的选择。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd1a9c1075e39513537adbbd6a4817d17e58c24db0425119c16fc2d48244bb5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ccf72e6b537a6c131544e01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盛夏──最好喝硬水。\r\n可以补充容易缺乏的矿物质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce0eae5d8dcd9f402dc8b7a3fd608923a0318983a94e35ade6325b10e57343fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01fa0a0525554c212f3c717a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "関節部への注油――\r\nもとい、ストレッチは――\r\nすでに――完了済みだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6561a1b2ac1047bf34de93d2534813df4b32f621f66d4b161c4441d8f01f456",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf2b9eba8890b0137741028d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精密無比の――技術。\r\n任務を果たす――意志。\r\n2つを――両立させたいものだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb8bebf6e730ad15cf04755ed8b4dea208336554aaa8ea15c3963b053948b77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab161d6bbfae9248eaaff1be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正確に――program――\r\n実行する。――機械人形のごとく。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ec7b0fa6dcc1d766b39169e940e4aea37e22b0e898b6fe70f17b0fe47cc3f6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35eb24b1b988d59eb3625262",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なんなりと――指示を。\r\n使命を果たすため――それに従う。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecfa05f98e35976eb727c9a2a372f956fc65ac983b80848e6ba25bbb80b29504",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08ea6deaf909547a6f626b1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "機械を――演じていようと――\r\nお前への――信頼に――\r\n変わりはない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02fe7fee705f849e909cda0612774eccc6d5019ff68e819f3e39fb28064eb41b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b10ae3b35a825823bef40e16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主よ。指令を。\r\n――やはり――トレーナーと\r\n呼ぶほうが――しっくりくるな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa4e869e2f150d7aba4419d5c9c406063e5feb386a1c4d5bcb000f5ea6f37824",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:225a85fd4b67d650012e9885",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "共に――任務を果たした時。\r\n未知の――感情を――\r\n私は――得るのだろうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0111096da69da315f15d060fb738843cbd6dbf653726d6b45a97a4087b08d1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b820adbc67947808033265",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很庆幸──你是我的签约训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e064bd7382879f3d3fe4df44ecbb31a5b01dd35a282513f9d9dcd3e12db22824",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdfdce85d3a768f3c165ebd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "I can't thank you enough.",
      "source_fingerprint": "d03f38609a55596815377e591bcbcaa17ca84eb7d17d12fceaa203750d7a9fe5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05af598837faea7a5735b457",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これほどの、感情は――初めてだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e097b16f4883866bd5ce9b6f933ed202d5a00888108f3a4fe7b4b0675de19e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ff48b4f0ac5816d40e2c389",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーは――最高のengineerだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbdb6256905d0b5e4d5f934beb272698e0018a12ba8ea551ff010c466cf2b181",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c27bbae9170166c7f66a4c37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能力──强化了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aee9fe11f2f62a68f7997c3324b5dfca72ea7253b83ea7c7c063225d7e6978e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b58e7fbfe184f242c8d6fa7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有──limit。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a344d097fb876ca2f392215b4f9cfcd97167f40b9ad7a7ab050f792c002cfa7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46fc6cc2f1ed64f6a1535cec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes.\r\n我是吉兆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d20682670d352059380f7f6a757326bf9494daaee04912b1036cf2aa1b1af39e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2693687a31bb7b4522e2a91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Mission──开始。\r\n一切都是为了报恩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5eda86805d9068e6df5c9c8c22476bd2569e34ff615469364d945c0742aea9e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19e2e7a0390b5960c941d185",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更有效率地进行支持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "292b09dd86c985b251461e0e855d22fd02036083fd5bb2206832d2037a9be63e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f893c8d44885b1d57b08996",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经改善并强化了合作体制。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71e77311b6a8d17ba9a271d14b2d70cf2f32366c33495fb0b98fe0a5e1ca8a80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0581491a540cf760b4eff7d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oilを――注されるとは――こんな気分か。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28307f2acb6b70380535c528233146f7a7d53bb77e7a1a00487646e8557b3d8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee1752c5d2192ac4d8156de3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拡張機能、解放――",
      "source_fingerprint": "71963ae95af02e18c318d304f56103fe1df9dead12a2806940388dc98e70dba2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87382c97c14934a72b710e44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目覚めさせたのは――お前か\r\n共に――使命を果たそう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02869396628039911cc12840b5a7014f02b485586d158d81e3dc219157101c39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
